  "body": "Opportunities to secure a position at this end of Cliff Road usually demand a far higher price tag. With a sharp price adjustment down to $1,899,000, my vendors have made their intentions clear, they are ready to meet the market. If you’ve been holding out for an unbeatable coastal view and a prime blue-chip address without the standard multi-million dollar buy-in, this is your move.\r\n\r\nWhat You’ll Love:\r\n- Uninterrupted front-row seat sweeping across the Hauraki Gulf, taking in the shipping lanes and changing tides without a single rooftop in your sightline\r\n- Entire upper-level parents' sanctuary featuring a oversized master, private lounge, and sun-drenched deck looking straight out to sea\r\n- Solid 1962 foundation built on a heavy-duty concrete block base and thoughtfully expanded over time for peace-of-mind living\r\n- Effortless indoor-outdoor flow connecting the light-filled conservatory and central kitchen to low-maintenance, landscaped gardens\r\n- Functional three-double-bedroom footprint supported by a double garage and a dedicated workshop space for hobbies or storage\r\n\r\nLife here is entirely defined by your proximity to the water. A short stroll down the driveway leads straight through a council reserve down to the sand at Ladder Bay for your morning swim. When you're off the beach, you're just minutes away from the vibrant cafes, shops, and everyday conveniences of both Torbay and Long Bay villages. Excellent schooling options like Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College round out a peaceful cul-de-sac lifestyle that sits close to everything.\r\n\r\nBest Bits From The Vendor:\r\n\"Look, it’s really the quiet rhythm of the place we’re going to miss. There’s something so calming about going to sleep with the waves breaking in the background and waking up to the sun coming over the islands... you don't even have to get out of bed to see it. We’ve spent hours just sitting on the deck watching dolphins or yachts racing right off the coast. It’s been so easy to pop down through the reserve for a quick swim or walk up to the village. Honestly, it’s going to be a hard place to leave.\"\r\n\r\nA rare chance to hold 680sqm of freehold prime Torbay land where privacy, position, and panoramic views align. Come through the open home or call today to lock in your position.\r\n\r\nReel Open Home: https://shorturl.at/JiJIH\r\n\r\n*Floor area and land area sourced from Auckland Council records.\r\nAgents happy to work in with your buyers.",
